<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Best Buy raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Best Buy raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Best Buy Co Inc to trading buy from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Best Buy gained 1-3/16 to 14-3/16.</p>
</text>
